#: scenario:scenario_ED60E24A_D5D2_4199_9D4A_E94A9D9B3689
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f73171fb74d524dc6b120f15ae798680f476f8d127c680ab8d75f2d418a27aec
#. default-sha256: 2efb3861ea0c1b6f669a12c9eabf84254d890677b114556121bf031a85ee056f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_ED60E24A_D5D2_4199_9D4A_E94A9D9B3689"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Master... ⟪k:7⟫What are your thoughts on the tale so far? ⟪k:8⟫"
"Which of the siblings do you think was in the right, Master—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫the brother, or the sister?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Mestre... ⟪k:7⟫Qual é a sua opinião sobre o conto até agora? "
"⟪k:8⟫Qual dos irmãos você acha que estava certo, Mestre—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫o irmão ou a irmã?"

#: scenario:scenario_E474E618_8ACA_4FF1_83AD_08FF723BF1FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d82d5a7dd6cc91bacc26f0898eacead6637edcbec11196cb10e93deb1c49ca52
#. default-sha256: fbd5985a12d922c7840ced688bdb0d748cdd57261e165ba6faa4a9d0b1c35c3e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E474E618_8ACA_4FF1_83AD_08FF723BF1FA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh my. I apologize for the abrupt question. ⟪k:1⟫Did I startle you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Oh, céus. Peço desculpas pela pergunta abrupta. ⟪k:1⟫Eu assustei você?"

#: scenario:scenario_8D2A83F4_D871_40E8_A3C0_7ECBEE106D84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c841465435a7a56041e1521b0ce666348558080f62c8af604a1de6cb0192645
#. default-sha256: 2662a911d4adc2a7c82b9008d772ee8b69c7f8edff61122ff972c887c919a699
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8D2A83F4_D871_40E8_A3C0_7ECBEE106D84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What do I think? ⟪k:1⟫Hmm, yes, I believe Mell was probably right. ⟪k:2⟫He was also surely "
"happier than her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O que eu acho? ⟪k:1⟫Hmm, sim, eu acredito que Mell provavelmente estava certo. ⟪k:2⟫Ele "
"certamente estava, também, mais feliz do que ela."

#: scenario:scenario_BD58283E_C541_4D18_BFD5_CEB565C496AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f7b3035b66ba0c456e51bd576edead35571481918e56dfaa197c710a6df7fce
#. default-sha256: 7fdb5192a6ea33f2fcff631f8d3ea75686caa127182d45875c5ec3f46662ef1c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BD58283E_C541_4D18_BFD5_CEB565C496AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As Mell had anticipated, Nellie fled from the theatre, leaving her fiancé behind."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Como Mell havia antecipado, Nellie fugiu do teatro, deixando seu noivo para trás."

#: scenario:scenario_840EC02B_37B4_4C56_AB9D_93EC372AEA6B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a318227416eaf116635c2478f7e9065903b578a836fd828124103acc1b6c1fe
#. default-sha256: c67eb1c42d41cc07657acacddf2253d25a49236b6115e33fa807e32325592ed4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_840EC02B_37B4_4C56_AB9D_93EC372AEA6B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She forced her way into a carriage stopped outside—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫probably one called for a "
"different nobleman—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and ordered it to take her home."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela se enfiou numa carruagem parada do lado de fora...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫provavelmente chamada por "
"outro nobre—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫e ordenou que a levasse para casa."

#: scenario:scenario_20148EFC_D4CA_43E2_83EE_685EC497B0EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 220d61d1faf8231f429fd698e7fa689d2794858374154b668ff11c2cff8be26d
#. default-sha256: e65398cd11ddfee7eef2d4fcdf3c6da04a46709042787564311ead5a323c0a05
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20148EFC_D4CA_43E2_83EE_685EC497B0EA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mell’s assumption was correct: the only place she had to return to was the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A suposição de Mell estava correta: o único lugar para onde ela poderia voltar era a mansão."

#: scenario:scenario_626B90C5_EA2A_46FA_856B_08250A0C7389
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62bd5f0651e64ecbf25b910e1b2bc2be5fed9959b4d3912e7e7c4f3b2bbe6316
#. default-sha256: c8268e9c5405a3017e43655f84f7ec240a22aa5985a545073fad1453153353a7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_626B90C5_EA2A_46FA_856B_08250A0C7389"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sun was beginning to set, and as a young lady, she could not simply go wandering through "
"town alone..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O sol estava começando a se pôr e, sendo uma jovem senhora, ela não podia simplesmente "
"passear pela cidade sozinha..."

#: scenario:scenario_0295D5D1_E317_4683_AD61_7F3D758B3BAC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0ed11c27f3188a93e68d8b573ccbeb28e2d8f3de8adca7417b0fd215f8afb16
#. default-sha256: 6a28aa412ab005c4f3a78661524d34694b685fc91bc797fe0b1f334f9ebdc325
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0295D5D1_E317_4683_AD61_7F3D758B3BAC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫nor did she have any acquaintances to take her in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫nem tinha conhecidos para acolhê-la."

#: scenario:scenario_587C9FC8_1040_46EF_B47A_57D5413ACBDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 572874900c72fed080b606e9211192d6cd00985a6d97d5f6b6469ee2bc99f6e4
#. default-sha256: 5e82f4fdf102968016e3f883b86a85b84117d8b7bbd3833309df04bc5a6bf232
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_587C9FC8_1040_46EF_B47A_57D5413ACBDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her world was, in essence, composed of two elements: her brother and the rose garden. ⟪k:1⟫"
"They were the light of her life at Rose Manor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seu mundo era, em essência, composto por dois elementos: seu irmão e o jardim de rosas. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Eles eram a luz de sua vida na Mansão das Rosas."

#: scenario:scenario_2FC3DD34_E481_4494_960C_D3D731B5A50D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80571c858a1451a1afc1a7ebebb6b478022380649c8e21fc018a484dd0283500
#. default-sha256: e15b063497095176cf91dba6940bd51f06765413b67b19f864ff4136505b35c1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2FC3DD34_E481_4494_960C_D3D731B5A50D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫She lived a very... ⟪k:2⟫isolated existence."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ela vivia uma existência...⟪k:2⟫muito isolada."

#: scenario:scenario_4DA89A01_3743_4A45_8132_C8AFB5DF153A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67ab93b5d6af37dadc0d2e84f7ed95ca4108634808b490b2ecfb482205b2b8e6
#. default-sha256: c2d4787868cf65d6c1bdcfd06e6ac8ddaa2b5c2f3de345d44e08c3e5abd4e500
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4DA89A01_3743_4A45_8132_C8AFB5DF153A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫...⟪k:15⟫Haah... "
"⟪k:16⟫hahh!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫...⟪k:15⟫Haah..."
"⟪k:16⟫haha!"

#: scenario:scenario_E911BDA9_03B0_4029_B41B_9AD978B127BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70940947fbf2a9af99779c843b216db0b9fcdb7d9a1b4e7ad7ba75555a15f8f5
#. default-sha256: 85b10fe01ebff3964caa3dcd63b99b3c42607cd8a725dd97f591b85e214ff73c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E911BDA9_03B0_4029_B41B_9AD978B127BA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫N-⟪k:3⟫Nnh... ⟪k:4⟫nnnnh..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫N-⟪k:3⟫Nnh...⟪k:4⟫nnnn..."

#: scenario:scenario_F8AB5E67_7037_4224_AB7C_700B0CAAA4CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1fbbc5be3ceffa191ce7678df22bdf25baa4e53cac59f203c2b3574925a85001
#. default-sha256: 61dfc278210f4917a2875932c5b52a33871875ab3302ce4470d6d05ba0a600cf
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F8AB5E67_7037_4224_AB7C_700B0CAAA4CC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫When she escaped back home, Nellie went straight to her room, locked the door, and "
"began sobbing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quando ela fugiu de volta para casa, Nellie foi direto para seu quarto, trancou a porta "
"e começou a soluçar."

#: scenario:scenario_D0C668EF_842A_47D6_BE44_D88B4989EA41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 258353bb0dbf7864d9a27f5c4961343b0c9e073f1c8f0e154e422300b93b2fb6
#. default-sha256: 50a6bc25d60439b91c65ac71c1a365e128bf0f998896645631bbdfd09beb576c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D0C668EF_842A_47D6_BE44_D88B4989EA41"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The waves of her sorrow came crashing effortlessly over the levees."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫As ondas de sua tristeza quebravam sem esforço sobre a barragem."

#: scenario:scenario_C53DB2DA_FA3D_46A2_B1F5_2C04ACCAB047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84eaf3491ead3d09aba8441991bc95a76729572f73910fbd628d739acc3e42fb
#. default-sha256: 95022b8cdd2612f4e155973d87363b64710d6bdf949c709bfd1afbbead2effa4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C53DB2DA_FA3D_46A2_B1F5_2C04ACCAB047"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Tears streamed through the cracked walls of the dams blocking her tear ducts."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Lágrimas escorriam pelas paredes rachadas da represa bloqueando seus canais lacrimais."

#: scenario:scenario_D1156FF3_8A4D_4CA6_B1E9_1CC2AA1D5D8D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ffa2db16e6a7d6f47aa581d155a872f3869c616cc9f8263c009e52f3c536cb4
#. default-sha256: 060252e33d5b06199a87f335cd09dbd3e805c0aabdcea3b0d15170ef9441fd20
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D1156FF3_8A4D_4CA6_B1E9_1CC2AA1D5D8D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mnh, ⟪k:3⟫w-⟪k:4⟫waaaah...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Why... ⟪k:7⟫whyyyy?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mnh,⟪k:3⟫w-⟪k:4⟫waaaah...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Por que... ⟪k:7⟫ por queeee?!"

#: scenario:scenario_4FD5280C_D2E4_41C6_84F8_3EFF0F211A3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68dc4106e14ba0783ae81253ee5cee93672193e48099163d83ad9f320d10dd1f
#. default-sha256: 60c7e01f12f77f9b05cf0f84428cd95bd1420f09a26c8b18db3cea60430eb070
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4FD5280C_D2E4_41C6_84F8_3EFF0F211A3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why won’t you help me, Mell...?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why won’t you take my side...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Por que você não me ajuda, Mell...?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Por que você não fica do meu lado...?"

#: scenario:scenario_CD837617_0249_467E_B012_5B7224AF6386
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b280a1c98834f948ed106311bc1d3b9b84e906f5e2f592ca8dfa3831734bb029
#. default-sha256: e4dc2f23fe5d4f1cbe49d801cbbe1f03f9c9ca05115c82efffe5d63c561df9b7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CD837617_0249_467E_B012_5B7224AF6386"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The decor in her room appeared blurry through her damp eyes. ⟪k:1⟫Memories of the day she "
"had it redecorated played back in her mind with crystal clarity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A decoração do seu quarto parecia embaçada através de seus olhos úmidos. ⟪k:1⟫As memórias do "
"dia em que ela o redecorou foram reproduzidas em sua mente com clareza cristalina."

#: scenario:scenario_431871F8_0EF3_4EB2_AC86_087BD5C0D022
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a36f0c4cb9f9e981b8c840ea11e3d04ef32c8a8f4b13b3abb4f4ad9904ff6f2
#. default-sha256: 5b1e4cd3ac85d6709e42859c4926f40c81d3db7f1624d5847a40b3d15b7c1a3d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_431871F8_0EF3_4EB2_AC86_087BD5C0D022"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫She told me... ⟪k:2⟫she had no feelings for you!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ela me disse... ⟪k:2⟫que não tinha sentimentos por você!"

#: scenario:scenario_7881CD7C_0E4C_4F4B_95F8_62EC1FBEBEE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b67a17979597ac368a5cd74cd0d357e9fe419d3b49d377dcd3dd252503e00a08
#. default-sha256: 576221a30d6cb47d7177f0d5f65ffeac8165350b99728d031006d7806832ca3e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7881CD7C_0E4C_4F4B_95F8_62EC1FBEBEE8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That liar!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That liar!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Aquela mentirosa!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Aquela mentirosa!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_BE9D3E3A_EC16_4BC5_8528_3DAA68428BC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b086f2c72dc604d260da32461fefa97009d526448b1b842bfebbc17e6c6ffa11
#. default-sha256: 3f1400cf47e81ca3f338255f397959cc5046245727ee7a31ac273458bbb2a565
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BE9D3E3A_EC16_4BC5_8528_3DAA68428BC5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She let her emotions run wild, breaking glass craftworks, silver plates designed by famous "
"foreign artisans, flower vases, all sorts of things."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela deixou suas emoções correrem soltas, quebrando artesanatos de vidro, pratos de prata "
"desenhados por famosos artesãos estrangeiros, vasos de flores, todo tipo de coisa."

#: scenario:scenario_179DAB7F_3499_4FDB_B483_45B8EC775B27
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6103eb6f11a61c7c6f58975aedd3c2b0a6fc40828e77e2bb28fd38acaaa3cebd
#. default-sha256: 467aef546228812140f8d690cde13a7d9be6a902ea8e1f86d85c0d849d203ab9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_179DAB7F_3499_4FDB_B483_45B8EC775B27"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was as though a beast had been set loose in her bedchamber."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era como se uma fera tivesse sido solta em seu quarto."

#: scenario:scenario_B812073A_9A8A_4DBD_8F0D_DE0CA1D9310D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b99684b24f7f362f25a3ff5353d22c9fd6c2db95518458cc363513e3231342b9
#. default-sha256: d5dfbea8168a7504cc13d5e1eeaab0fb9589f2f804a901c0daf5d521c94522b4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B812073A_9A8A_4DBD_8F0D_DE0CA1D9310D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫—!⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫—!⟪k:2⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_30ECB1CF_30F8_4DF3_B4AB_9E1A23286DDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1287220331f3e8f63ee70d18fbacf8ddedd77e46babae4755897c0da3e82ce39
#. default-sha256: 76ffe34af4b2f0eb1cdcaaa6a72f8dde438d78e1b6791b820fbb78ee23fd5b30
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_30ECB1CF_30F8_4DF3_B4AB_9E1A23286DDF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The vase she tossed shattered against a painting hanging on the wall, spraying water, "
"porcelain, and roses in every direction."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O vaso que ela jogou quebrou contra uma pintura pendurada na parede, espirrando água, "
"porcelana e rosas em todas as direções."

#: scenario:scenario_84F082A5_A3E5_4E7E_8AC5_6484D5DC1230
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ef3bd3792eb15e5041ddcfd6401accbdae586d6d9ab2261617a183c0f822ad8
#. default-sha256: 95ac2e9f01512f3bcd023f85e30cdf49917ece3cffa1adca7ce40a8529d236bd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_84F082A5_A3E5_4E7E_8AC5_6484D5DC1230"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was the portrait she adored so dearly—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫of her and her brother."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era o retrato que ela tanto adorava...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫dela e do irmão."

#: scenario:scenario_3DABB154_376C_4289_A9E0_041E20822ACB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9dd8762dfc83a91b704bb690326c26f815f03ee7d5fb31e7377d8458fd288fa7
#. default-sha256: c9de2df8c36868adafc2eb1b0ab01e94d2f7404dacab36d2465d743f6c505ba6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3DABB154_376C_4289_A9E0_041E20822ACB"
